# Mitigated LiteLLM latency-routing lost updates

Memory type: episodic_memory
Recorded: 2026-08-14T16:45:00Z
Confidence: 0.86
Owner: Aisha Bello
Tags: litellm, issue-24720, latency-routing, concurrency, sre

## Summary

Issue #24720 was reproduced with two concurrent success callbacks reading the same latency-map snapshot. The scoped mitigation serializes read/modify/write operations per latency-map key, preserving both deployment measurements while leaving unrelated model groups concurrent. The changed Python files compile; focused pytest remains required because the mounted offline environment lacks pytest and uncached httpx==0.28.1.

## Outcome

Fix, regression test, incident timeline, and operator runbook reviewed against the reproduction and personal branches; no process-wide lock was introduced.

